##MSG_NOMERKEN
$(NORMAL)\n$(COL{1})No files remembered ( Remember with $(BOLD)MERKEN$(NORMAL)$(COL{1}) )\n\n
##MSG_DOWNLOADJN
$(NORMAL)Download? ($(BCOL{4})$(BOLD)j$(NORMAL)$(BCOL{0})) Yes, ($(BCOL{4})$(BOLD)N$(NORMAL)$(BCOL{0})) No, De($(BCOL{4})$(BOLD)L$(NORMAL)$(BCOL{0}))ete.
##MSG_LOGOUT
$(NORMAL)Close connection after download? ($(BCOL{4})$(BOLD)j$(NORMAL)$(BCOL{0})) Yes, ($(BCOL{4})$(BOLD)N$(NORMAL)$(BCOL{0})) No.
